Hi,

I'm looking for a host based stats program.  I'm looking for something that
will show my the usual stats info, in particular I'd like to see cpu time &
percentage, in/out traffic, # of users (using tomcat, not # of users logged
into box), avg user time, etc...  If possible I'd like to find a program
that would output graphs with user definable date ranges.  Program could be
console based or web-based (java preferred).

The system is a standalone web-server, running Slackware 8.1 (2.4.20),
Tomcat 4.x, MySQL 3.23.

I've looked at ACID & Snort but at first glance they looked to be more of an
intrusion detector vs. a stats program, and require php which is not
currently installed and I'd rather not install it on this particular machine
if at all possible.

Any suggestions appreciated.

